+/*
+ * General kernel memory allocation:
+ *  SCTP_MALLOC(element, type, size, name)
+ *  SCTP_FREE(element)
+ * Kernel memory allocation for "soname"- memory must be zeroed.
+ *  SCTP_MALLOC_SONAME(name, type, size)
+ *  SCTP_FREE_SONAME(name)
+ */
